  "name": "Dragon Den - Killfeed",
  "slug": "dragon-den-killfeed",
  "teaser": "Adds an on-screen killfeed showing attacker, victim, weapon, ammo, body part, and distance. Includes faction icons and full customization options.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/inusG08JLMtuqS08Ys0BwZJUQIQ6i7zwfiO9soPZ.png",
  "downloads": 10262,
  "favourites_count": 10,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Killfeed showing every kill in a corner</li>\n<li>Displays attacker, victim, weapon, ammo type, body part and distance</li>\n<li>Includes faction icons for USEC, BEAR, Scav, and Unknown</li>\n<li>Customizable layout: choose top/bottom left/right corner</li>\n<li>Adjustable margins, font size, color, and spacing between lines</li>\n<li>Configurable display duration and fade-out speed for each kill</li>\n<li>Set max number of killfeed lines (if shown more than max, it removes oldest ones)</li>\n<li>Option to include or hide kills from other players and bots</li>\n<li>Text format using tokens: {attacker}, {victim}, {bp}, {weapon}, {ammo}, {dist}</li>\n<li>Adjustable faction icon tint and toggle for visibility</li>\n<li>Semi-transparent background for readability</li>\n<li>All settings configurable directly through BepInEx menu</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Unpack the zip and drop the user folder into your SPTarkov root.</p>\n<p>(Use 7Zip <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Here</a>)</p>\n<p>Install demo video (credit to Drakia):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"Demonstration\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>None that I know of.\nHave not tested it with Fika.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Drakia</strong> for: The install video</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is Dragon Den</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Dragon Den</strong> is my twist on Tarkov. It’s where cuteness, edgyness, and weirdness all collide, while still keeping things believable.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traders with their own quirks and attitude</li>\n<li>Custom items and quests that feel fresh</li>\n<li>Backpacks, armor, facewear and headwear with personality</li>\n<li>Odd creations that shouldn’t exist… but somehow fit right in</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No weapons, just everything else that makes Tarkov less boring.</p>\n<p>Want to reach me? Look for #drexiras-dragon-den in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/WelcomeToTarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Welcome To Tarkov’s Discord</a></p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"jFKQn02TFjE\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jFKQn02TFjE?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jFKQn02TFjE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n",
